translate french whitneyjacksonburgerstartdate_46ab1c69:

    # "About half an hour later, Whitney picks me up at my house and we drive over to Jackson Burger, chit-chatting along the way."
    "Environ une demi-heure plus tard, Whitney passe me prendre chez moi et on se rend au Jackson Burger en voiture, en bavardant pendant tout le trajet."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyjacksonburgerdate.rpy:30
translate french whitneyjacksonburgerstartdate_e86c27fb:

    # "Then we sit in the back in my usual booth."
    "Puis on s'installe au fond, sur ma banquette habituelle."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyjacksonburgerdate.rpy:34
translate french whitneyjacksonburgerstartdate_c38e7520:

    # "We sit and chat more while eating our burgers."
    "On continue de discuter en mangeant nos burgers."

# game/Scenes/Whitney/WhitneyDates/whitneyjacksonburgerdate.rpy:37
translate french whitneyjacksonburgerstartdate_a5a3cfb1:

    # "When we're finished, she pays for the food and I cover the tip, then we go outside."
    "Quand on a fini, elle paie le repas et je m'occupe du pourboire, puis on sort."

